  "worked_solution": "Notice that the vertex of $∠QPR$ is point $P,$ not point $R.$ So $∠QPR$ is *not* a straight angle.\n\nWe can think of $∠QPR$ as:\n\n- a *null* angle, if we assume that it doesn't turn at all (diagram on the left), or\n\n- a *full* angle, if we assume that it makes one full turn (diagram on the right).\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14131901/assets/25de8b3fe57372fb5371a6aaf0f14933f1616e33f2c093c9de32c594b57829f4.png)\n\nSo, the answer is 'Null' or 'Full'.",
